approximately 10,000 rape kits


00:05:58.399 --> 00:06:00.945
sitting in this annex
to the property room,"


00:06:00.969 --> 00:06:03.012
and that none of us
even knew existed.


00:06:03.037 --> 00:06:05.182
We knew about the Detroit Police
Department main property room,


00:06:05.206 --> 00:06:07.018
but we did not know
that there were other places


00:06:07.042 --> 00:06:09.587
within the department
they were storing evidence.


00:06:09.611 --> 00:06:13.912
And so I said, "You've got to be
kidding me," or some words to that effect.


00:06:17.218 --> 00:06:19.229
It's so disturbing.


00:06:19.253 --> 00:06:20.311
Yep.


00:06:25.727 --> 00:06:29.772
So do we know exactly
how long the...


00:06:29.797 --> 00:06:31.743
The kits were stored here?


00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:35.313
All we know is the day we found
out, which was August of '09.


00:06:35.337 --> 00:06:37.281
<i>Wow.</i>


00:06:37.305 --> 00:06:38.783
Do we know how many
were stored here?


00:06:38.807 --> 00:06:40.117
- All of them.
- All of them.


00:06:40.142 --> 00:06:42.186
All of them, yeah.


00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.531
So it looks like they're in
the process of tearing it down.


00:06:55.625 --> 00:06:57.870
You know, once I get
rid of the shock of it,


00:06:57.894 --> 00:06:59.772
of we discovered the kits,


00:06:59.796 --> 00:07:01.173
but I'm not surprised.


00:07:01.197 --> 00:07:02.974
The victims of these...


00:07:02.999 --> 00:07:04.677
That are attached to these kits
are overwhelmingly women.


00:07:04.701 --> 00:07:07.012
And very few report,


00:07:07.036 --> 00:07:10.715
and those that report are
historically treated very badly.


00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.620
It's not just the fact that nobody
cared about these women.


00:07:13.644 --> 00:07:16.156
It's not the fact that they
treated them with no dignity.


00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.558
It's the fact that they were
violated in the most intimate of ways,


00:07:18.582 --> 00:07:20.193
and nobody gave a damn.


00:07:20.217 --> 00:07:22.208
Nobody gives a damn
about women in this country.


