to be able to track


00:54:01.420 --> 00:54:03.431
with today's technology,


00:54:03.456 --> 00:54:05.233
a victim's rape kit through
the criminal justice system.


00:54:05.257 --> 00:54:07.102
I've said long since 2009


00:54:07.126 --> 00:54:08.702
