when I found out about Helena.


01:04:20.862 --> 01:04:24.141
Just by his character,
I could tell


01:04:24.165 --> 01:04:29.747
that I wasn't the only one
he'd done things to.


01:04:29.771 --> 01:04:31.215
I knew there
was other people out there,


01:04:31.239 --> 01:04:33.316
and there probably
still is more out there.


01:04:33.340 --> 01:04:35.286
You know, he was a truck driver,


01:04:35.310 --> 01:04:40.124
from Ohio, Indiana,
to California.


01:04:40.148 --> 01:04:42.259
Helena's from California,


01:04:42.284 --> 01:04:46.497
so in all honesty, I believe
there's more women out there,


01:04:46.521 --> 01:04:50.968
along the way
that he's probably...


01:04:50.992 --> 01:04:52.756
'Cause he's a serial rapist.


01:04:56.098 --> 01:04:58.999
In Amberly's case,
Charles took a plea.


01:05:00.403 --> 01:05:03.236
And he got sentenced
to 30 years.


01:05:06.310 --> 01:05:09.108
No. My family did.


01:05:11.848 --> 01:05:14.180
The State of Ohio
vs. Charles Courtney Jr.


01:06:31.765 --> 01:06:35.110
For my own case,
because it had been so long,


01:06:35.134 --> 01:06:37.880
the statute of limitations
had expired,


01:06:37.904 --> 01:06:41.115
and they were not able
to charge him with rape.


01:06:41.140 --> 01:06:44.787
But the D.A. found
a loophole, which was to say


01:06:44.811 --> 01:06:47.056
that because he had taken
$20 from my wallet,


01:06:47.080 --> 01:06:50.359
it was now abduction with
intent to commit another crime,


01:06:50.383 --> 01:06:53.062
which was to take my $20.


01:06:53.086 --> 01:06:56.232
That was the only reason that
we were able to file a charge at all,


01:06:56.257 --> 01:07:00.102
and because of that,
they were able to get him


01:07:00.126 --> 01:07:02.338
to plea to 25 years to life.


01:07:02.363 --> 01:07:04.274
But if he hadn't done that,


01:07:04.298 --> 01:07:07.277
if we hadn't found that
loophole, that exception,


01:07:07.301 --> 01:07:11.247
there wouldn't have been
any justice for me.


01:07:15.843 --> 01:07:17.287
Something that I've found
every since then


01:07:17.311 --> 01:07:20.858
is that I'm not angry
at Charles Courtney.


01:07:20.882 --> 01:07:23.326
I have long moved past
that feeling,


01:07:23.350 --> 01:07:26.964
and I feel like terrible things
happen to people.


01:07:26.988 --> 01:07:31.069
Violence is learned,
and I have compassion for him.


01:07:31.093 --> 01:07:35.406
I don't have compassion for
the system that made this okay.


01:07:35.430 --> 01:07:40.144
Because the system should
be more accountable,


01:07:40.168 --> 01:07:42.914
<i>the system should be...</i>


01:07:42.939 --> 01:07:45.150
The system should be
better than a criminal.


01:07:45.174 --> 01:07:49.353
If they would
have took it more serious


01:07:49.377 --> 01:07:52.189
and believed Helena
and did their jobs


01:07:52.214 --> 01:07:57.962
and ran her rape kit
in a timely manner,


01:07:57.986 --> 01:07:59.330
I would have never got raped,


01:07:59.354 --> 01:08:01.915
'cause he would have
already been caught.


01:08:05.328 --> 01:08:09.041
I just have this feeling,
to this day


01:08:09.065 --> 01:08:13.913
that there are rape kits
that haven't been processed


01:08:13.937 --> 01:08:16.997
that his DNA is on
across this nation.


01:08:19.943 --> 01:08:23.121
And I wouldn't be surprised if
they found a body attached to him.


01:08:23.145 --> 01:08:26.047
I wouldn't be surprised if
he killed one of those victims.


01:08:39.963 --> 01:08:41.407
It's me, it's Ericka.


01:08:41.431 --> 01:08:45.078
My sister challenged me
to the gospel challenge.


01:08:45.103 --> 01:08:46.180
I can't sing, either.


01:08:46.204 --> 01:08:49.081
We two non-singing sisters,


01:08:49.106 --> 01:08:51.285
but I'm going to sing anyway,
okay?


01:08:51.309 --> 01:08:54.388
Don't judge me when my CD
starts skipping, either.


01:08:54.412 --> 01:08:58.091
With me


01:08:58.116 --> 01:09:03.031
Wt is well IX


01:09:03.055 --> 01:09:07.067
With me, it is


01:09:07.091 --> 01:09:08.904
An organization
that I was working with,


01:09:08.928 --> 01:09:10.906
we were putting on a conference,


01:09:10.930 --> 01:09:12.908
and Kym Worthy was
one of our speakers,


01:09:12.932 --> 01:09:15.310
because it was national news
about the abandoned warehouses


01:09:15.334 --> 01:09:17.812
that the rape kits were in.


01:09:17.836 --> 01:09:22.917
When she started talking about
the findings and the numbers,


01:09:22.942 --> 01:09:27.890
before that day, I don't think I
connected it mentally or emotionally.


01:09:27.914 --> 01:09:30.025
And I said to her, I was like,


01:09:30.050 --> 01:09:34.296
"I just wanted you to know that
those numbers, I'm one of them.


01:09:34.320 --> 01:09:36.398
You know what I mean?
Like, it's not just numbers.


01:09:36.422 --> 01:09:39.367
Like, here I am in front of you.


01:09:39.391 --> 01:09:41.936
Like, you're talking about me."


01:09:41.961 --> 01:09:45.074
And her face,
she was, like, blown away.


01:09:45.098 --> 01:09:46.408
Like, "Oh, my God."


01:09:46.433 --> 01:09:48.209
She hugged me
and she held my hand,


01:09:48.233 --> 01:09:50.178
and she said,
"You know what, call me."


01:09:50.202 --> 01:09:51.981
She said, "I'm going
to follow up with you."


01:09:52.005 --> 01:09:53.482
She didn't lie.


01:09:53.506 --> 01:09:55.418
I didn't reach out to her,
she reached out to me.


01:09:55.442 --> 01:09:59.154
She told me,
"We have found your kit,


01:09:59.179 --> 01:10:02.325
and if you want to move
forward, we can move forward."


01:10:02.349 --> 01:10:04.094
And my biggest thing was
the shame.


01:10:04.118 --> 01:10:07.163
People will know,
people will know.


01:10:07.187 --> 01:10:09.299
I had to learn in this process


01:10:09.323 --> 01:10:11.101
the shame that's
associated with this,


01:10:11.125 --> 01:10:12.802
'cause it is a shameful thing.


01:10:12.827 --> 01:10:15.772
It's not mine, it's his.


01:10:15.796 --> 01:10:21.201
And I got the courage to go
ahead and take the next step.


01:10:31.445 --> 01:10:36.194
Okay, so here we go.


01:10:36.218 --> 01:10:38.743
I've been carrying
something for 12 years.


01:10:41.256 --> 01:10:45.470
On Facebook, everybody sees
how, you know, I advocate


01:10:45.495 --> 01:10:47.872
for different things,
and y'all know I'm a part


01:10:47.896 --> 01:10:51.060
of a larger community
of workers.


01:10:52.268 --> 01:10:56.280
So, um, on my 21 st birthday,


01:10:56.304 --> 01:10:58.851
I was sexually assaulted
by someone,


01:10:58.875 --> 01:11:00.786
and I had a rape kit done,


01:11:00.810 --> 01:11:02.744
<i>and, um...</i>


01:11:05.848 --> 01:11:08.060
it's been sitting on the shelf.


01:11:08.084 --> 01:11:11.497
So all of those 11,000 untested
rape kits that they found,


01:11:11.522 --> 01:11:12.818
I had one of them.


01:11:14.523 --> 01:11:19.204
But that's been my biggest
secret for 12 years.


01:11:19.228 --> 01:11:21.373
It's been 12 years
my birthday this year.


01:11:21.397 --> 01:11:23.041
I just had to get it out,


01:11:23.066 --> 01:11:25.377
and stop trying
to hide and sneak,


01:11:25.401 --> 01:11:27.179
and people ask me questions,


01:11:27.203 --> 01:11:29.415
and I'm, like, not being
all the way honest.


01:11:29.440 --> 01:11:30.770
You know what I mean?


01:11:33.176 --> 01:11:34.521
Well, I'm sorry for whatever


01:11:34.545 --> 01:11:36.322
you had to experience
as far as that.


01:11:36.346 --> 01:11:38.223
I hope they catch
the son of a bitch


01:11:38.247 --> 01:11:41.115
and put him far,
far back in the jail.


01:11:42.553 --> 01:11:44.164
I'm proud of you.


01:11:44.188 --> 01:11:46.167
I'm glad you're releasing


01:11:46.191 --> 01:11:49.202
whatever's holding
you down, definitely.


01:11:49.226 --> 01:11:52.206
Yeah, I already feel better now.


01:11:52.230 --> 01:11:53.356
I'm ready.


01:11:56.867 --> 01:11:58.545
When I reflect back,


01:11:58.570 --> 01:12:02.150
one of my favorite words
that I learned is "unapologetic."


01:12:04.142 --> 01:12:06.386
So I have learned to be
unapologetic


01:12:06.411 --> 01:12:10.792
