and what I believe.


01:12:10.816 --> 01:12:13.427
So, Alise, you know
why I'm taking Spanish?


01:12:13.451 --> 01:12:16.297
For the neighbors.


01:12:16.322 --> 01:12:18.400
So I can talk
to the neighbors better.


01:12:18.424 --> 01:12:20.135
Mm-hmm.


01:12:20.159 --> 01:12:22.103
So I started
a block club on our street.


01:12:22.128 --> 01:12:24.372
- Oh.
- Whoo-hoo.


01:12:24.396 --> 01:12:26.888
I'm getting ready
