01:12:28.869 --> 01:12:31.279
I'm evidence that regardless
of what happens to you,


01:12:31.303 --> 01:12:32.881
you can get through it.


01:12:32.905 --> 01:12:34.917
You can move past it,
you can grow,


01:12:34.941 --> 01:12:36.752
you can change for the better.


01:12:36.777 --> 01:12:40.790
I am evidence that
there's more to that box.


01:12:40.814 --> 01:12:42.458
It's a human being there.


01:12:42.482 --> 01:12:45.461
This is not just a kit,
this is a person.


01:12:50.991 --> 01:12:52.836
Be careful, it's ice.


01:12:52.860 --> 01:12:54.487
And the God that I believe in...


01:12:56.428 --> 01:12:58.974
we don't have
to get a victory at court.


01:12:58.999 --> 01:13:01.730
Bye, Imani. Bye!


01:13:07.774 --> 01:13:09.352
You still get
what's coming to you.


01:13:09.376 --> 01:13:10.468
I'll be free.


01:13:39.440 --> 01:13:40.985
<i>Hey!</i>


01:13:41.009 --> 01:13:42.875
I brought you some good news.


01:13:44.446 --> 01:13:47.191
- Guess who's in jail?
- Out here, too?


01:13:47.216 --> 01:13:49.207
Nope, down in
North Carolina still.


01:13:50.285 --> 01:13:51.963
So how are you?


01:13:51.987 --> 01:13:53.799
I'm okay.


01:13:53.823 --> 01:13:57.268
I had some difficulties
when this first came up


01:13:57.292 --> 01:14:00.406
with new feelings about it.


01:14:00.430 --> 01:14:03.908
<i>'Cause I hadn't thought
about it since it...</i>


01:14:03.932 --> 01:14:06.345
You know, I pretty much
buried it since it had happened.


01:14:06.369 --> 01:14:10.783
As soon as I saw his face
on that sheet, like,


01:14:10.807 --> 01:14:13.385
I just knew right away
who he was.


01:14:13.409 --> 01:14:18.191
Like, I'll never... Like, I didn't
think about that face, but now...


01:14:18.215 --> 01:14:20.478
Yeah, like, I never forgot.


01:14:22.385 --> 01:14:23.964
We just don't know if he'll plea,


01:14:23.988 --> 01:14:25.765
we don't know
if it'll go to trial.


01:14:25.789 --> 01:14:27.467
With all three of our cases,


01:14:27.491 --> 01:14:30.803
