01:14:35.834 --> 01:14:38.378
for our one victim
that was younger than you.


01:14:38.401 --> 01:14:40.512
If he got max,


01:14:40.536 --> 01:14:43.316
he's looking
at a minimum of 33 years.


01:14:43.340 --> 01:14:45.284
- Oh, wow.
- If he got max.


01:14:45.308 --> 01:14:47.419
- Wow, that's...
- And those are set sentences.


01:14:47.443 --> 01:14:48.878
- That's great.
- I know.


01:14:49.947 --> 01:14:51.891
Thank you so much.


01:14:51.916 --> 01:14:53.393
Nice job being so strong.


01:14:53.417 --> 01:14:56.396
Thank you, you helped me.


01:14:59.925 --> 01:15:02.369
Linda, you want
to tell us about the stats?


01:15:02.393 --> 01:15:03.827
Sure.


01:15:05.462 --> 01:15:11.277
We have in progress


01:15:11.302 --> 01:15:14.238
We've completed 790 cases.


01:15:16.508 --> 01:15:19.487
These rape kits are the best bargain


01:15:19.511 --> 01:15:21.222
in the history
of law enforcement.


01:15:21.246 --> 01:15:23.190
$400 a rape kit,


01:15:23.214 --> 01:15:25.860
and one in four
results in an indictment.


01:15:25.885 --> 01:15:30.299
One in four of the four
is a serial rapist.


01:15:30.323 --> 01:15:32.901
I've never seen an opportunity
like this in law enforcement.


01:15:32.925 --> 01:15:34.503
It'll never happen again.


01:15:34.527 --> 01:15:36.972
My goal is to get
grand jury time every week.


01:15:36.996 --> 01:15:39.941
You can't change or fix
what happened to one person.


01:15:39.966 --> 01:15:41.810
You know, you can be
empathetic about it,


01:15:41.834 --> 01:15:43.446
you can listen,
you can tell their story,


01:15:43.470 --> 01:15:45.380
but you can't change that.


01:15:45.404 --> 01:15:47.964
What you can change is what
might happen to someone else.


01:15:54.347 --> 01:15:55.792
Hey, how are you?


01:15:55.816 --> 01:15:57.011
I'm good, I'm good.


01:16:01.422 --> 01:16:02.732
Thank you very much.
You take care.


01:16:02.756 --> 01:16:03.800
- Thank you.
- Thank you.


01:16:03.824 --> 01:16:05.383
Bye-We-


01:16:08.029 --> 01:16:10.773
It's so funny, I remember having
a conversation with Mariska,


01:16:10.797 --> 01:16:13.310
and we talked about how
we had 100 serial rapists,


01:16:13.334 --> 01:16:16.012
and we were like,
"Wow, how can that...


01:16:16.037 --> 01:16:19.316
100 people out still raping


01:16:19.340 --> 01:16:23.352
because the kits that pointed
to them weren't tested."


01:16:23.377 --> 01:16:25.022
And that meant, you know,
many more than that,


01:16:25.046 --> 01:16:26.857
because we knew that...


01:16:26.881 --> 01:16:28.324
'Cause these were
the identified serial rapists.


01:16:28.348 --> 01:16:32.362
And now we have 770?


01:16:32.387 --> 01:16:34.431
I think it's, like, 774.


01:16:34.455 --> 01:16:38.435
Over 770
identified serial rapists.


01:16:38.459 --> 01:16:40.437
That's almost a thousand!


01:16:40.461 --> 01:16:44.808
Over 770 identified serial
rapists just out of this project,


01:16:44.832 --> 01:16:48.111
just in one city,
in one county, in one state.


01:17:00.883 --> 01:17:02.027
I've been getting these reports


01:17:02.051 --> 01:17:03.828
about what you've been doing,


01:17:03.852 --> 01:17:06.397
and it's a constant education
for all of us now.


01:17:06.422 --> 01:17:08.868
There's been a lot of talk


01:17:08.892 --> 01:17:11.002
about the progress that's
been made, and it's been...


01:17:11.026 --> 01:17:14.373
I mean, I don't know that I
really sat back and appreciated it.


01:17:14.397 --> 01:17:16.976
We have no training
in med school,


01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:19.778
P.A. school, nursing school
on how to do these kits.


01:17:19.803 --> 01:17:23.082
And now we go into the
hospitals, train physicians,


01:17:23.106 --> 01:17:25.084
the P.A. schools,
the nursing schools,


01:17:25.108 --> 01:17:27.486
looking to try
and standardize programs.


01:17:27.510 --> 01:17:29.455
So we've been working
with partners


01:17:29.479 --> 01:17:31.290
at the state level to try
and get that in place


01:17:31.314 --> 01:17:35.761
to make sure that there
are programs everywhere.


01:17:35.785 --> 01:17:37.363
What we saw in Detroit was
that when you pull them


01:17:37.387 --> 01:17:38.865
off the shelf and you test them,


01:17:38.889 --> 01:17:39.966
and this has
happened in Cleveland,


01:17:39.990 --> 01:17:41.101
it's happened in Los Angeles,


01:17:41.125 --> 01:17:42.936
it's happened in New York.


01:17:42.960 --> 01:17:45.171
When you test them and
you start seeing the matches,


01:17:45.196 --> 01:17:47.808
the hits, kit to kit to kit.


01:17:47.832 --> 01:17:50.111
So the proof's in the pudding.


01:17:50.135 --> 01:17:53.480
How do we rebuild survivors'
trust in the criminal justice system?


01:17:53.504 --> 01:17:55.748
There needs to be an apology,


01:17:55.773 --> 01:17:59.087
and we need to be creating
different solutions, different options.


01:17:59.111 --> 01:18:03.124
We need to be bringing survivors
in to say, "Give us another chance."


01:18:03.148 --> 01:18:06.993
The benefit to public safety
of testing these kits


01:18:07.017 --> 01:18:09.329
is almost impossible
to put into words.


01:18:09.353 --> 01:18:10.930
The day that it sank in for me


01:18:10.955 --> 01:18:13.733
is when Detroit Police
Department sent me...


01:18:13.757 --> 01:18:15.403
I don't know,
it might have been you, Marvin.


01:18:15.427 --> 01:18:16.871
When you sent me
that list of victims' names.


01:18:16.895 --> 01:18:19.406
Because a kit is a kit,
you know.


01:18:19.430 --> 01:18:21.075
But when you get
that list of names,


01:18:21.099 --> 01:18:24.045
and it just scrolls down,
and it doesn't stop,


01:18:24.069 --> 01:18:25.780
and it just keeps going
and going and going.


01:18:25.804 --> 01:18:27.481
You're, like,
saying to yourself,


01:18:27.506 --> 01:18:29.984
"All right, this is something
where we can't rest, right?


01:18:30.008 --> 01:18:31.919
This is something
where we have to go till...


01:18:31.943 --> 01:18:33.889
you know,
we have this leader right here


01:18:33.913 --> 01:18:35.956
just pursuing the justice.


01:18:35.981 --> 01:18:37.925
I know y'all talk
about me behind my back.


01:18:37.949 --> 01:18:40.062
In a... in a good way.


01:18:42.088 --> 01:18:44.833
We've been at
this since August of 2009.


01:18:44.857 --> 01:18:47.502
Our results from our testing


01:18:47.527 --> 01:18:52.174
have links to crime scenes
from 39 other states.


01:18:52.198 --> 01:18:56.913
So that means there's only
ten states in the United States


01:18:56.937 --> 01:19:00.916
that haven't been affected by our
rape kits that were found in one city.


01:19:00.940 --> 01:19:04.387
If anything positive
has happened from all of this,


01:19:04.411 --> 01:19:06.122
it's that people
are talking about it,


01:19:06.146 --> 01:19:09.458
and people know about it,
and others have come forward.


01:19:19.760 --> 01:19:21.138
Just got a phone call


01:19:21.162 --> 01:19:25.156
from the investigators and...


01:19:29.470 --> 01:19:32.482
So we know my kit
has been tested.


01:19:32.507 --> 01:19:38.022
We know that I picked
a person out of a lineup.


01:19:38.046 --> 01:19:41.711
We know that that person
has been questioned...


01:19:43.418 --> 01:19:46.096
and their DNA was taken


01:19:46.120 --> 01:19:47.918
at the time
that they were questioned.


01:19:49.958 --> 01:19:55.829
The test results are in,
and the profiles match.


01:19:57.866 --> 01:20:02.045
And I feel very free,


01:20:02.070 --> 01:20:05.268
and I feel... I feel new.


01:20:08.243 --> 01:20:11.856
And I want
to encourage other women


01:20:11.880 --> 01:20:14.292
who may be watching this video
that have experienced a rape,


01:20:14.316 --> 01:20:18.530
a molestation,
any act of violence,


01:20:18.554 --> 01:20:24.270
to press forward,
because I feel strong.


01:20:24.294 --> 01:20:29.175
I feel stronger than
I've ever known I can feel,


01:20:29.199 --> 01:20:32.945
and in ways that I've
never known that I could.


01:20:32.969 --> 01:20:35.147
All right, I'm done, I'm done.


01:20:35.171 --> 01:20:37.550
I gotta get it together.


01:20:37.574 --> 01:20:39.551
Oh, man, but I love you all
and thank you.


01:20:39.576 --> 01:20:41.122
God bless.


